# The repository root ignores *.json, which would swallow the generator's pinned
# manifest. It is an input, not an artifact: fetch.sh runs `bun install` here and
# extract.mjs reads what that resolves, so the pin has to be committed for the
# generated Scala under kyo/uic/generated to stay reproducible.
!package.json

# What `bun install` writes is not.
node_modules/
